<title>INDONESIA: Jababaeka says '96 net up to 175 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Jababaeka says '96 net up to 175 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian real estate firm PT Kawasan Industri Jababeka said in a statement on Tuesday that it posted net profit of 175 billion rupiah in 1996.</p>
<p>Jababeka posted net profit of 137 billion rupiah in 1995.</p>
<p>The statement did not give any more details.</p>
</text>
